<div class="container">

<h1>📚 Book Management System</h1>

<p>A simple web-based Book Management System that allows users to manage books efficiently.</p>

<hr>

<h2>🚀 Features</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Add new books 📖</li>
    <li>View all books 📋</li>
    <li>Update book details ✏️</li>
    <li>Delete books ❌</li>
    <li>Simple and user-friendly UI</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>🛠️ Tech Stack</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li>
    <li><strong>Backend:</strong> Java / Spring Boot (optional)</li>
    <li><strong>Database:</strong> MySQL (optional)</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>📂 Project Structure</h2>
<code>
book_management/<br>
│── index.html<br>
│── README.md<br>
│── (other files)
</code>

<hr>

<h2>▶️ How to Run the Project</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Clone the repository:</li>
</ol>

<code>
git clone https://github.com/DipanshuTheCoder123/book-management-system-.git
</code>

<ol start="2">
    <li>Open the project folder</li>
    <li>Run the project: Open <code>index.html</code> in your browser</li>
</ol>

<hr>

<h2>💡 Future Improvements</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Add login/signup system 🔐</li>
    <li>Connect with database (MySQL)</li>
    <li>Convert into full-stack using Spring Boot</li>
</ul>

